{"seq":2,"at":"2026-11-22T06:06:43.104Z","layer":"proof-kit","why":"Clarify the purpose of the assumption box in Chinese","by":"cli","ops":[{"op":"text.set","in":"parts","path":"parts.impI.desc","lang":"zh","value":"假设框用来证明「若 A，则 B」。在「假设」栏设定 A，然后在框内以 A 为临时前提证明 B。将证出的 B 接到「结论」端口，框外便得到 A \\mark{implies} B。"}],"files":[{"file":"packages/proof-kit/i18n/zh.json","after":"1410916c4335933c"}],"inverse":[{"op":"text.set","in":"parts","path":["parts","impI","desc"],"value":{"en":"A box, with A set on the part. Inside, A may be used as an assumption; prove B there and wire it to “Conclusion”, and the part gives A \\mark{implies} B.","zh":"带一个框，A 在元件上设定。框内可以使用假设 A；框内证出 B 并接到「结论」，元件输出 A \\mark{implies} B。","$key":"part.impI.desc"}}]}
